//
// hex_rig — an ASSEMBLY of bodies, the frames it poses into, and how its axles sit on ground.
//
// Left `moros_sim` at plan 19 `L6.3b`. It was never Moros: measured name by name, these three
// modules use nothing from `moros_map`, `moros_editor` or `moros_render`, and the editor
// server imported eight of their names to put a cart on the wire.
//
// ⚠ `use self::` ON EVERY MODULE — loft#976. `assembly`, `frames` and `ground` are ordinary
// enough basenames that a consumer's graph could hold another of each.
use self::assembly;
use self::frames;
use self::ground;
